  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Rinse red lentils. Cut cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957a142dc4b928198865d/step-de2baa00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook ginger paste, mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water, coconut milk and stock concentrate, stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957a142dc4b928198865d/step-98c5ee10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the saucepan, add lentils. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium.\n• Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until lentils are softened, 20-22 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, roughly chop silverbeet.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957a142dc4b928198865d/step-f45e4120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place mini flourtortillas on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle each with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Bake until warmed through, 4-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957a142dc4b928198865d/step-a478cf30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir roasted cauliflower and silverbeet through dhal. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the dhal, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957a142dc4b928198865d/step-da43a440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Divide cauliflower and silverbeet lentil dhal between bowls.\n• Top with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt and chilli. Serve with tortillas. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957a142dc4b928198865d/step-d11a8850.jpg"
    }
  ]
